main                         |oo--------@------@oo|
develop                      | <o---@----@--@o|
release/1.0                  |               <o|
hotfix/crash                 | <-------o|
feature/login                |  <ooo|
feature/payments             |      <oo|
feature/old-search (deleted) |           <oo|

fork        main @1 -> develop @2
fork        develop @2 -> feature/login @3
merge       feature/login @5 -> develop @6
fork        develop @6 -> feature/payments @7
fork        main @1 -> hotfix/crash @9
merge       hotfix/crash @9 -> main @10
merge       hotfix/crash @9 -> develop @11
