merge       feature/old-search (deleted) @13 -> develop @14
fork        develop @15 -> release/1.0 @16
merge       release/1.0 @16 -> main @17
cherry-pick feature/payments @8 -> main @18

@5   Keep the session after login             feature/login
@8   Fix rounding in amount formatting        feature/payments
@9   Fix crash on empty config                hotfix/crash
@15  Fix typo in docs                         develop, origin/develop
@16  Bump version to 1.0                      release/1.0
@17  Merge branch 'release/1.0'               v1.0
@18  Fix rounding in amount formatting        origin/main
@19  Update changelog                         main
